"}]},{"verse_key":"25:6","surah":25,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَنزَلَهُ ٱلَّذِى يَعْلَمُ ٱلسِّرَّ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ غَفُورًا رَّحِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘It was sent down by Him who knows the secrets of the heavens and earth. He is all forgiving, all merciful.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلَهُ","en_gloss":"Has sent it down","transliteration":"anzalahu","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسِّرَّ","en_gloss":"the secret","transliteration":"l-sira","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَفُورًۭا","en_gloss":"Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūran","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَّحِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīman","verse_key":"25:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:6"}]},{"verse_key":"25:7","surah":25,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ مَالِ هَـٰذَا ٱلرَّسُولِ يَأْكُلُ ٱلطَّعَامَ وَيَمْشِى فِى ٱلْأَسْوَاقِ ۙ لَوْلَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْهِ مَلَكٌ فَيَكُونَ مَعَهُۥ نَذِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They also say, ‘What sort of messenger is this? He eats food and walks about in the marketplaces! Why has no angel been sent down to help him with his warnings?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they sa